font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=229 valign=top style='width:171.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.2pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <td width=307 valign=top style='width:230.4pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=229 valign=top style='width:171.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <td width=307 valign=top style='width:230.4pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=102 valign=top style='width:76.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=84 valign=top style='width:63.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=229 valign=top style='width:171.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.45pt'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CLINICAL NOTES<\/span><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> :<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The Lp(a) test is used to\r\nidentify an elevated level of lipoprotein (a) as a possible risk factor in the\r\ndevelopment of cardiovascular disease (CVD). The test may be used in\r\nconjunction with a routine lipid profile to provide additional information\r\nabout a person's risk for CVD. The Lp(a) level is genetically determined and\r\nremains relatively constant over an individual's lifetime. Since it is usually\r\nnot affected by lifestyle changes or by most drugs, it is not the target of\r\ntherapy. Instead, when Lp(a) is high, the presence of this added risk factor\r\nmay suggest the need for more aggressive treatment of other, more treatable\r\nrisk factors such as an elevated low-density lipoprotein (LDL).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"153.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 40.5pt"}}